      "missing_expression": "The source player would miss the Waking Dream Remnant economy as its OWN resource (a color-streamed pickup meter, made mono-color by Lucid Dreaming) -- we render it as reservation-swap + on-kill fill, losing the pickup-stream texture and the purple-damage-stack ramp.",
